#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:80
#: 1f46e90898db46a0a681336f94814f7e
msgid ""
"`colcon build --symlink-install`. Lean branches (`arx-lift2s`, `panthera-"
"ht`): prefer **`./quick_start.sh`** (it sources `install/setup.bash` after a"
" successful build). On `main`, after colcon, `source install/setup.bash` in "
"the launch terminal (standard ROS overlay; no extra env script)."
msgstr ""
"`colcon build --symlink-install`。精简分支（`arx-lift2s`、`panthera-ht`）：优先 "
"**`./quick_start.sh`**（构建成功后它会 source `install/setup.bash`）。在 `main` "
"上，colcon 之后在启动终端 `source install/setup.bash`（标准 ROS overlay；没有额外环境脚本）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:82
