"`src/robot-descriptions-arx` or `git submodule update --init "
"manipulator/ARX` under the umbrella. Prefer the deploy-ws init script when "
"you are in `open-deploy-ws`."
msgstr ""
"[robot-descriptions-arx README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-"
